{"repositoryId":214977479,"availability":"available","full":"czasg/pywss","name":"pywss","description":"一个轻量级的 Python Web 框架，一站式集成 MCP SSE、StreamHTTP 和 MCPO 协议，助你轻松构建MCP Server🔥","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":99,"forks":22,"created":"2019-10-14T07:33:17Z","updated":"2025-07-16T10:30:35Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://czasg.github.io/pywss/","topics":["mcp","mcp-server","python","python-web","pywss","web","web-framework"],"demo":"https://czasg.github.io/pywss/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.103Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.103Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.103Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.103Z","stars":99,"forks":22}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Pywss（发音 /piːwaɪz/，类似 pwhys）是一个轻量级的 Python Web 框架，它基于 Python3.6+ 特性构建。","与 Flask、Django 等主流框架不同的是，Pywss 的底层并没有实现 WSGI 接口协议。 其编程风格也更类似于 Gin、Iris 等框架，因此对于熟悉这些框架的开发者来说，Pywss 是一个非常值得探索的项目。"],"features":["简单：拒绝海量参数，减少心智负担。了解上下文 pywss.Context 即刻启程。","快速：引入线程池机制，减少并发场景下线程创建/销毁开销。","优雅：ctx.next 真的太优雅了。如果你也和我一样喜欢，那我觉得这件事情，泰裤辣！！","标准化：集成了部分 OpenAPI（Swagger）能力，方便开发者快速生成 API 文档并进行调试。","支持WebSocket：开箱即用的 WebSocket 能力。"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/czasg/pywss/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"f6cd1904185e1d0067412598c2f1e140672bade2184d3764f4aeb2f3877f9ce8","extractedAt":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.260Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.260Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Pywss（发音 /piːwaɪz/，类似 pwhys）是一个轻量级的 Python Web 框架，它基于 Python3.6+ 特性构建。","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/czasg/pywss/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"f6cd1904185e1d0067412598c2f1e140672bade2184d3764f4aeb2f3877f9ce8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/czasg/pywss/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T05:00:53.260Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-07-16T10:30:35Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"http